;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\昼の月.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "$FF80FF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\子供の写真.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Me and my <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE>, and then <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were all the same age, and the three of us were always running around the hills and fields together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE>, smart and a natural leader, and <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>, kind, like a goddess.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was truly fortunate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> and a <STYLE ID="2">childhood friend</STYLE> like them, mine was the happiest boyhood there could be.<PG>
But when did it start?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This feeling that I didn't measure up to these two.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whenever I was in trouble, my <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> always helped me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whenever I was in trouble, <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> always helped me.<PG>
When the two of them were in trouble, what could I do?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As my heart changed from a child's to an adult's, the way I thought about the two of them had begun to change too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I could do... what was it?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was around my second year of middle school that I started asking that question in earnest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\豊岳中学.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> began to be bullied at school because of her looks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Supposedly the trigger was a delinquent upperclassman making passes at <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>, and the girls who hung around him, jealous of it, were the ones who started it.<PG>
Young people today probably don't know this, but back in the day, being a delinquent meant things like riding motorbikes through the school building and going around smashing every window in the school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Our area in particular was the countryside, so that breed of so-called country delinquent was still around.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ学生バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The bullying of <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> was terrible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\工業油.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "9" "200" "80" "30" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Dousing <STYLE ID="2">Sakura's</STYLE> skin with murky brown industrial oil, pressing lit cigarettes against her legs.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The worst was when they carried her off on a motorbike, tied her up, and left her in the mountains in the summer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And when they did, they smeared honey all over her body.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\虫.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then the mountain insects, drawn by the honey, crawled all over <STYLE ID="2">Sakura's</STYLE> body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Grotesque insects, so strange you couldn't tell what family they belonged to, crawled over Sakura's body all day.<PG>
This was no longer anything you could call bullying. It was plain crime.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They tormented <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> in body and mind in every way they could.<PG>
How do I know all this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because I was a witness to the bullying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why was I a witness?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because those guys went out of their way to bring me along and make me watch <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> suffer.<PG>
Unlike my <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE>, I was timid and servile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no idea how to get <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> out of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those guys knew about that weakness inside me.<PG>
If I told anyone about the bullying, the same thing would happen to me...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I couldn't tell anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Coming from me, her childhood friend, the words 'there was no bullying' would be what the adults trusted more than anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was testimony that held up only because <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> and I trusted each other―
{PAUSE ""}
by making me a witness, they made sure I could never testify about the bullying.<PG>
But my <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> was different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> saw through bullying like that in no time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And thinking of me as well, he didn't go to the adults either.<PG>
My <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> got in with the gang himself, <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="もくろん">scheming</STYLE> to see if he could make it collapse from the inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> was trying to do what my <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> could do.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I was so frustrated.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was frustrated with myself for being unable to do anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> was always telling me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ学生バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE> she'd say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could never answer <STYLE ID="2">Sakura's</STYLE> words with anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Saying 'sorry' myself―saying 'are you okay?'―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't give back a single one.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The adults of Arata had noticed this bullying of <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if the adults knew about it, those guys might think I'd been the one who talked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">That was probably why. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> told the adults not to interfere in any way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was her problem, so she would solve it herself, she said.<PG>
Solve it herself?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is she talking about? All she's doing is taking the violence however they hand it out and waiting quietly for it to end...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on top of that, I'm supposed to keep watching while <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> gets treated like that!?<PG>
Besides, the way things are now, it's my fault that <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> is being bullied!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because if I try to help <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>, I'll become the target of the bullying...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I kept quiet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was aware of the reality that this was exactly what was fueling the bullying of <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>.<PG>
There was no one I could rely on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't trust myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> was someone I could rely on, but my <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE>, for <STYLE ID="1">his</STYLE> part, seemed to be plotting something to help <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't get in my <STYLE ID="1">brother's</STYLE> way for the sake of someone like me.<PG>
But from a certain day on, most of the gang stopped coming to school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Word was that some infighting had turned into a criminal case and they'd been sent to juvenile detention.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the one who had lit that spark was none other than my <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> had wiped out the gang in spectacular fashion.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, what's up? Long face, and it's spring."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We sat on the veranda, our identical faces side by side.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Same face, same build, and yet what went on inside our heads was completely different.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, just thinking about something. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> problem is settled, so I've been feeling easier lately too. That's my </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> for you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"About that, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"You know the </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ライオンキャッツ">Lion Cats</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Um... that gang from the next city over, right? Supposedly they've got ties to the yakuza."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Their boss fell for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and dumped his girlfriend, word is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And here I thought things had worked out with the guys at our school..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then that girlfriend he dumped..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If this keeps up, things could get bad. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That girlfriend might sic a girls' biker gang on Sakura."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The ones who'd been bullying <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE> until recently were, when you got down to it, nothing more than our local country hoodlums.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ライオンキャッツ">Lion Cats</STYLE> were in a whole other league from them, in notoriety and in sheer viciousness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she caught the eye of someone connected to people like that―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll do what only I can do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you do what only </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> can do."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... what can I do...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Just </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> being by </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> side should be enough to put </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at ease."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Me...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> haven't noticed?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well... fine. This is between </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. Not my place to butt in."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
My <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> said that and walked away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had my <STYLE ID="1">brother</STYLE> been trying to say?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just me being with <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, it couldn't be...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>... feels that way about me...?<PG>
That can't be. Someone useless like me, there's no way...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Never mind dreams like that. What matters is how to protect <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before things get out of hand, this time I have to do something about it.<PG>
So that this time I really can protect <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>, I have to be of use too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I could be useful, then <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There I go again... what am I thinking?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
