Before spring break was over, I pored through the storehouse's books with a dictionary of classical Japanese in hand, trying to find the wisdom to help <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There had to be... there absolutely had to be something...!<PG>
