About 500 years ago, a Westerner named Sele and others, about 20 in all, reached the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Westerners, who had begun to <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="なじ">fit in</STYLE> at the Arata settlement of that time, wondered whether they could bring eternal peace to this land―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was what they began searching for.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All to make this Arata settlement a true paradise.<PG>
