In Shiyo 310, Motoyoshi Magawa, a warlord of the most illustrious of houses, was struck down by a certain minor daimyo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The news delighted the people of the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The drug's effects had been proven.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Historians of later ages are still studying, even today, how the minor daimyo struck down Motoyoshi Magawa.<PG>
