But the age passed to the Ouda, the <STYLE ID="10">Fuji</STYLE>, and then the <STYLE ID="11">Togawa</STYLE>, and in time the drug vanished from history for a while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reason is uncertain, but wasn't using the drug too heavy a price, even for winning the realm?<PG>
But then an incident occurred that drew attention to the drug once more.<PG>
At that time, there was a religious group called the Holy Cerejeira Church around Megasawa City.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were apparently an offshoot that had split off from the Arata settlement several hundred years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In order to study Droga, their sacred implement, scientifically, they negotiated with Arata and had the cherries it was made from supplied to them.<PG>
One cherry tree was still left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I succeeded in making this drug, then I...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
