{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―<STYLE ID="2">Sakura's</STYLE> face was clouded.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Days of never knowing when that gang would show up.<PG>
Looking back, it would have been fine to turn to the settlement's adults.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike before, it wasn't a matter of me becoming the target of the bullying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I had ruled that option out from the start.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I could save <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>, I could be a hero.<PG>
It's a pathetic thing to admit, but I think that, back then, somewhere in my heart, there was that kind of elation.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, there's something I want you to see today. </STYLE>
